     "<p dir=\"ltr\">Buen día,</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">(I used Google translate so I&#39;m sorry if I misunderstand your message).</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Are you using R? If so, have you tried the line: install.packages(&quot;RPostgreSQL&quot;, repos =&quot;<a href=\"http://cran.us.r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.us.r&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792488482576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ZiVcJMiI4KHWPsoND08Yx\">http://cran.us.r</a>=project org&quot;)<br>\r\n?</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sometimes downloading packages from different CRAN repositories gets confusing for R; I&#39;m not sure why. </p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Best,<br>\r\nJillian</p>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Mon, Apr 7, 2025, 6:02 PM  &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">wallac...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #d3d3d3;max-width:850px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000\">\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;padding:10px 20px\">\r\n    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n      <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"width:70%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:18px/20px arial;color:#333\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/wallaceecomod/topics\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:#333\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/wallaceecomod/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792488482576000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02h9-ynxz4m0Oyq5yYluzs\">\r\n              wallac...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"text-align:right;width:30%\